<Layout title={"₹8.4 Crore Saved for a Mid-Size Manufacturer"}>
<article class="detail-page"><a class="detail-back" href="/publications/">← Back to publications</a><div class="section-label">Case study</div><h1>₹8.4 Crore Saved for a Mid-Size Manufacturer</h1><div class="detail-content modal-body">
      <h4>The Situation</h4>
      <p>A Delhi-based auto components manufacturer with ₹115Cr annual revenue had seen EBITDA margins compress from 14% to 8.3% over three years. The MD believed the issue was market pricing pressure. Our diagnosis told a different story.</p>
      <h4>What We Found</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>187 active vendors — many duplicating each other, none with formal contracts or SLAs</li>
        <li>Procurement decisions made by 6 different people with no central policy or approval matrix</li>
        <li>Logistics costs 31% above industry benchmark due to poor load planning</li>
        <li>₹2.1Cr in annual overhead spend with no clear business justification (identified via Zero-Based Budgeting)</li>
        <li>Energy consumption 18% above sector norms due to aging equipment and no consumption tracking</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="modal-kpis">
        <div class="modal-kpi"><div class="modal-kpi-val">₹8.4Cr</div><div class="modal-kpi-label">Annual Savings</div></div>
        <div class="modal-kpi"><div class="modal-kpi-val">27%</div><div class="modal-kpi-label">Cost Reduction</div></div>
        <div class="modal-kpi"><div class="modal-kpi-val">4.2×</div><div class="modal-kpi-label">ROI on Fees</div></div>
      </div>
      <h4>What We Did</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Vendor rationalisation — reduced from 187 to 64 strategic vendors with formal contracts</li>
        <li>Designed and implemented a centralised procurement policy with a 3-tier approval matrix</li>
        <li>Renegotiated terms with top 15 vendors — average price reduction of 8.4%</li>
        <li>Applied Zero-Based Budgeting across all overhead categories — eliminated ₹2.1Cr of unjustified spend</li>
        <li>Redesigned logistics flow — consolidated loads reduced freight cost per unit from ₹42 to ₹29</li>
        <li>Installed energy monitoring — identified and addressed top 5 consumption outliers</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>The Outcome</h4>
      <p>Within 14 weeks, ₹8.4Cr in annualised savings were identified and implementation was underway. EBITDA margin recovered from 8.3% to 14.7% within the following financial year. The client's CFO described it as "the highest-ROI initiative we've run in a decade."</p>
